The MW version-inline template is intended to be used to document items that are only available with or following specified versions of the MediaWiki software. The template is a "lighter" version of the {{tl|MW version}} template. It does not occupy as much space as that template, in order that it can be added to running text or lists.

== Example ==
{{tlx|MW version-inline|MW 1.15+}} provides → {{MW version-inline|MW 1.15+}}
<includeonly>
[[Category:MediaWiki version templates]]
</includeonly>
<templatedata>
{
	"params": {
		"1": {
			"label": {
				"en": "Version",
				"cs": "Verze"
			},
			"example": "MW 1.35+",
			"type": "string",
			"required": true
		}
	},
	"format": "inline"
}
</templatedata>

